<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEVERKUSEN SIGN BRAZILIAN STRIKER RINK.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEVERKUSEN SIGN BRAZILIAN STRIKER RINK.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian striker Paulo Rink has joined Bayer Leverkusen from Atletico Paranaense for seven million marks ($4 million), the German club said on Sunday.</p>
<p>He becomes Leverkusen's second Brazilian big-money signing of the close season. The Bundesliga runners-up bought midfielder Emerson from Gremio for eight million marks ($4.7 million) earlier this month.</p>
